{"overview":"حملهٔ نژاد فضایی به نام اونی، زندگی جدیدی برای آتارو موروبوشی، دانش‌آموز دهم‌کلاس شیطانی و مزاحم در شهر کوچک توموبیکِی آغاز می‌کند. پس از اینکه به‌طور ناخودآگاه به جای محبوبش شینوبو، به ملکه اونی، لومن اینوادر، عهده‌نامهٔ ازدواج می‌دهد، آتارو تبدیل به کانال ارتباطی برای فراگیران فضایی می‌شود و باعث هرج‌ومرجی برای خودش و دوستانش می‌شود، نه‌کشی به شهرتش هم می‌رسد!","tagline":"","overview_en":"The invasion of an alien race known as the Oni begins a new life for Ataru Moroboshi, a lecherous trouble-making tenth grader in the small town of Tomobiki. After unwittingly proposing to the Oni princess Lum Invader instead of his sweetheart Shinobu, Ataru becomes a conduit for aliens arriving on Earth, causing all sorts of havoc for him and his companions, not to mention his own reputation!","tagline_en":"Grab her horns and she might just become your darling!","runtime":26,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":15,"y":1982,"poster":"/siOr7YWjvVSbYWysG15xk5ty7a7.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":218,"y":1981,"poster":"/gjczHNyDjIVZ9V7auLPHSq3KIQu.jpg"}],"episodes":218,"crew":["やまざきかずお"],"crew_en":["Kazuo Yamazaki"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"古川登志夫","role":"Ataru Moroboshi","photo":"/zZjO0NxIbEhYW3507gXVnvWeRkG.jpg","en":"Toshio Furukawa"},{"name":"平野文","role":"Lum","photo":"/nP3c7cxj4iCHKCrlJtxtnsF3prS.jpg","en":"Fumi Hirano"},{"name":"神谷明","role":"Syutaro Mendo","photo":"/tJRMwbWFObv03KhATALs0Xbbgq7.jpg","en":"Akira Kamiya"},{"name":"島津冴子","role":"Shinobu Miyake","photo":"/nmolDxpMBTX5p7WTqjqC7VUpz0n.jpg","en":"Saeko Shimazu"},{"name":"کازوکو سوگیاما","role":"Ten","photo":"/mJYbhWLVvoK6PtD1fpeGJHA8W83.jpg","en":"Kazuko Sugiyama"},{"name":"鷲尾真知子","role":"Sakura","photo":"/qJkhSBhyRt1GRNcEuZB5xPTonEK.jpg","en":"Machiko Washio"},{"name":"永井一郎","role":"Sakurambou","photo":"/d5LuqwoIjMIqKvKmEk5y6AZY1Ww.jpg","en":"Ichiro Nagai"},{"name":"小原乃梨子","role":"Oyuki","photo":"/u5dvWzckBXvZw8Oexn5VN08vW7G.jpg","en":"Noriko Ohara"},{"name":"三田ゆう子","role":